<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Architecture" id="zRX7HXn9QETwk7o4niZq">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nskinparam monochrome true\nskinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF\nskinparam shadowing false\nskinparam defaultFontSize 11\nskinparam rectangle {\n  RoundCorner 0\n  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n  BorderColor #000000\n}\nskinparam note {\n  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF\n  BorderColor #000000\n}\nskinparam ArrowColor #000000\n\n&#39; ===================== TẦNG 1 =====================\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Tầng 1 – Trình bày (Presentation)&lt;/b&gt;\\nReactJS (Web Responsive), gọi API bằng Axios, real-time bằng Socket.IO Client\&quot; as L1 {\n  rectangle \&quot;Cổng Sinh viên\\nFR 1.1 đến 1.10\&quot; as P1\n  rectangle \&quot;Cổng Nhà tuyển dụng\\nFR 2.1 đến 2.9\&quot; as P2\n  rectangle \&quot;Trang Quản trị viên\\nFR 3.1 đến 3.9\&quot; as P3\n}\n\n&#39; ===================== TẦNG 2 =====================\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Tầng 2 – Nghiệp vụ (Business)&lt;/b&gt;\\nPython + Flask, Flask-SocketIO\&quot; as L2 {\n  rectangle \&quot;Router\\n(các endpoint /api/...)\&quot; as B1\n  rectangle \&quot;Socket.IO\\n(online, gửi tin, đang gõ,\\nđã xem, gọi WebRTC)\&quot; as B2\n  rectangle \&quot;Middleware: xác thực JWT NFR-04,\\nphân quyền theo vai trò NFR-05\&quot; as B3\n  rectangle \&quot;Middleware: kiểm tra dữ liệu đầu vào\\nNFR-07, kiểm tra tệp ≤ 10MB NFR-08\&quot; as B4\n\n  rectangle \&quot;AuthService: đăng ký, OTP,\\nđăng nhập, đổi mật khẩu,\\nhủy tài khoản\\n(1.1, 1.2, 2.1, 2.2, 3.1, 3.2)\&quot; as S1\n  rectangle \&quot;StudentProfileService:\\nhồ sơ, thư giới thiệu,\\nCV mặc định (1.3, 1.4)\&quot; as S2\n  rectangle \&quot;CompanyService: hồ sơ\\ndoanh nghiệp, tải lại GPKD,\\nlogo / ảnh bìa (2.3)\&quot; as S3\n  rectangle \&quot;JobService: tìm, lọc,\\nlưu việc làm, đăng tin,\\nchuyển trạng thái tin (1.5, 2.4)\&quot; as S4\n  rectangle \&quot;ApplicationService: nộp đơn,\\nchặn nộp trùng, hủy đơn,\\nduyệt / từ chối (1.5.6, 1.6, 2.5)\&quot; as S5\n  rectangle \&quot;ReviewService: chỉ đánh giá\\nkhi tin Hoàn thành, tính điểm\\ntrung bình (1.7, 2.6, 3.6)\&quot; as S6\n\n  rectangle \&quot;ChatService: phòng chat theo cặp\\nSinh viên – Nhà tuyển dụng,\\nchế độ chỉ đọc, lọc từ cấm\\n(1.8, 1.10, 2.7, 2.9, 3.9)\&quot; as S7\n  rectangle \&quot;NotificationService:\\nphát và quản lý thông báo\\n(1.9, 2.8)\&quot; as S8\n  rectangle \&quot;ReportService: báo cáo vi phạm,\\nmỗi tin chỉ báo 1 lần, xử lý\\n(1.5.7, 1.8.5, 2.5.6, 2.7.5, 3.8)\&quot; as S9\n  rectangle \&quot;UserAdminService:\\nkhóa / mở khóa tài khoản,\\nduyệt GPKD (3.4)\&quot; as S10\n  rectangle \&quot;JobModerationService:\\nẩn / bỏ ẩn, xóa tin\\nvi phạm (3.5)\&quot; as S11\n  rectangle \&quot;CategoryService,\\nStatisticsService: danh mục\\n(3.7), thống kê (3.3)\&quot; as S12\n}\n\n&#39; ===================== TẦNG 3 =====================\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Tầng 3 – Truy cập dữ liệu (Data access)&lt;/b&gt;\\nPython + PyMongo, mẫu Repository\&quot; as L3 {\n  rectangle \&quot;UserRepository\\n(users, student_profiles,\\nemployers)\&quot; as R1\n  rectangle \&quot;ProfileRepository\\n(cover_letters, resumes)\&quot; as R2\n  rectangle \&quot;CompanyRepository\\n(company_profiles)\&quot; as R3\n  rectangle \&quot;JobRepository\\n(jobs, bookmarks)\&quot; as R4\n  rectangle \&quot;CategoryRepository\\n(categories)\&quot; as R5\n  rectangle \&quot;ApplicationRepository\\n(applications)\&quot; as R6\n  rectangle \&quot;ReviewRepository\\n(reviews)\&quot; as R7\n  rectangle \&quot;ChatRepository\\n(chat_rooms, messages,\\nbanned_keywords)\&quot; as R8\n  rectangle \&quot;NotificationRepository\\n(notifications)\&quot; as R9\n  rectangle \&quot;ReportRepository\\n(reports)\&quot; as R10\n}\n\n&#39; ===================== TẦNG 4 =====================\nrectangle \&quot;&lt;b&gt;Tầng 4 – Lưu trữ (Storage)&lt;/b&gt;\\nMongoDB Atlas – 16 collection theo ERD; tệp lưu ở Cloud Storage, CSDL chỉ lưu URL\&quot; as L4 {\n  rectangle \&quot;users\&quot; as C1\n  rectangle \&quot;student_profiles\&quot; as C2\n  rectangle \&quot;employers\&quot; as C3\n  rectangle \&quot;company_profiles\&quot; as C4\n  rectangle \&quot;cover_letters\&quot; as C5\n  rectangle \&quot;resumes\&quot; as C6\n  rectangle \&quot;jobs\&quot; as C7\n  rectangle \&quot;categories\&quot; as C8\n  rectangle \&quot;bookmarks\&quot; as C9\n  rectangle \&quot;applications\&quot; as C10\n  rectangle \&quot;reviews\&quot; as C11\n  rectangle \&quot;chat_rooms\&quot; as C12\n  rectangle \&quot;messages\&quot; as C13\n  rectangle \&quot;notifications\&quot; as C14\n  rectangle \&quot;reports\&quot; as C15\n  rectangle \&quot;banned_keywords\&quot; as C16\n  rectangle \&quot;Cloud Storage: CV, GPKD (PDF),\\nlogo / ảnh bìa (PNG, JPG), tệp chat\&quot; as X1\n  rectangle \&quot;Dịch vụ Email (SMTP):\\ngửi mã OTP\&quot; as X2\n}\n\n&#39; ===== Xếp hàng: -right- giữ cùng hàng, -down- đẩy xuống hàng dưới (đường ẩn, chỉ để bố cục) =====\nP1 -[hidden]right- P2\nP2 -[hidden]right- P3\nB1 -[hidden]right- B2\nB2 -[hidden]right- B3\nB3 -[hidden]right- B4\nS1 -[hidden]right- S2\nS2 -[hidden]right- S3\nS3 -[hidden]right- S4\nS4 -[hidden]right- S5\nS5 -[hidden]right- S6\nS7 -[hidden]right- S8\nS8 -[hidden]right- S9\nS9 -[hidden]right- S10\nS10 -[hidden]right- S11\nS11 -[hidden]right- S12\nR1 -[hidden]right- R2\nR2 -[hidden]right- R3\nR3 -[hidden]right- R4\nR4 -[hidden]right- R5\nR6 -[hidden]right- R7\nR7 -[hidden]right- R8\nR8 -[hidden]right- R9\nR9 -[hidden]right- R10\nC1 -[hidden]right- C2\nC2 -[hidden]right- C3\nC3 -[hidden]right- C4\nC4 -[hidden]right- C5\nC5 -[hidden]right- C6\nC6 -[hidden]right- C7\nC7 -[hidden]right- C8\nC9 -[hidden]right- C10\nC10 -[hidden]right- C11\nC11 -[hidden]right- C12\nC12 -[hidden]right- C13\nC13 -[hidden]right- C14\nC14 -[hidden]right- C15\nC15 -[hidden]right- C16\nX1 -[hidden]right- X2\nB1 -[hidden]down- S1\nB2 -[hidden]down- S2\nB3 -[hidden]down- S3\nB4 -[hidden]down- S4\nS1 -[hidden]down- S7\nS2 -[hidden]down- S8\nS3 -[hidden]down- S9\nS4 -[hidden]down- S10\nS5 -[hidden]down- S11\nS6 -[hidden]down- S12\nR1 -[hidden]down- R6\nR2 -[hidden]down- R7\nR3 -[hidden]down- R8\nR4 -[hidden]down- R9\nR5 -[hidden]down- R10\nC1 -[hidden]down- C9\nC2 -[hidden]down- C10\nC3 -[hidden]down- C11\nC4 -[hidden]down- C12\nC5 -[hidden]down- C13\nC6 -[hidden]down- C14\nC7 -[hidden]down- C15\nC8 -[hidden]down- C16\nC9 -[hidden]down- X1\nC13 -[hidden]down- X2\n\n&#39; ===================== Gọi giữa các tầng =====================\nL1 -down-&gt; L2 : HTTP + JSON (REST) và WebSocket (Socket.IO)\nL2 -down-&gt; L3 : gọi hàm Repository\nL3 -down-&gt; L4 : PyMongo\n\n&#39; ===================== Chú thích =====================\nlegend bottom left\n  &lt;b&gt;Chú thích:&lt;/b&gt; mũi tên = tầng trên gọi tầng dưới (phụ thuộc một chiều, không gọi ngược, không bỏ qua tầng).\n  Số trong ngoặc là mã chức năng trong sheet Functional Requirement.\n  &lt;b&gt;Ngoài phạm vi:&lt;/b&gt; cổng thanh toán, giao dịch tiền thật, ứng dụng di động native.\nendlegend\n\n@enduml\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="Lmtvks4RY7wiR-Wkk34V-1">
